# .NET conventions

- Prefer records/DTOs at the HTTP edge and explicit entities in Domain.
- One handler per use case (`AuthorizeHandler`, `ResolveApprovalHandler`, `ReportExecutionHandler`).
- Persist the decision and the audit event in the same EF transaction before returning ALLOW or REQUIRE_APPROVAL.
- Use prefixed ids (`org_`, `agt_`, `dec_`, `apr_`, `perm_`).
- JSON at the HTTP boundary is snake_case.
